      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3  The compiler runs the app and reports only\nto Root. Root is an ordinary manager:\njust the last stop.",
      "originalText": "3  The compiler runs the app and reports only\nto Root. Root is an ordinary manager:\njust the last stop.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 54
    },
    {
      "id": "n1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 640,
      "y": 446,
      "width": 356,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 540264830,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 405896783,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1  Worker B asks for getTickets. No child of\nManager promises it, so the ask climbs one\nlevel to Root, whose child Worker C does.\nThe answer comes back down the same hops.\nWorker B never talks to Worker C.",
      "originalText": "1  Worker B asks for getTickets. No child of\nManager promises it, so the ask climbs one\nlevel to Root, whose child Worker C does.\nThe answer comes back down the same hops.\nWorker B never talks to Worker C.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 94
    },
    {
      "id": "n2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 604,
      "width": 383,
      "height": 80,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 489931973,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 389119164,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2  Manager's builder finds that Worker A reads\na name Worker B never promised. Both sit under\nManager, so Manager settles it: the reader\nchanges. Root never hears of it.",
      "originalText": "2  Manager's builder finds that Worker A reads\na name Worker B never promised. Both sit under\nManager, so Manager settles it: the reader\nchanges. Root never hears of it.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 74
    },
